<title>FINLAND: Rauma 8-mth sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Rauma 8-mth sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown by division of January-August net sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p>				  Jan-Aug 96    Jan-Aug 95    Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Timberjack			1,354	   1,791	   2,763</p>
<p> Sunds Defibrator		2,372	   1,822	   3,077</p>
<p> Nordberg			  1,228	   1,282	   2,072</p>
<p> Neles-Jamesbury		 1,277	   1,047	   1,674</p>
<p> Other operations		  293	     284	     532</p>
<p> Intra-group sales		-147	    -183	    -281</p>
<p> TOTAL			     6,377	   6,043	   9,837 @</p>
<p>Operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p>				  Jan-Aug 96    Jan-Aug 95    Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Timberjack			 107	     254	     386</p>
<p> Sunds Defibrator		 204	     122	     267</p>
<p> Nordberg			    47		57		81</p>
<p> Neles-Jamesbury		  135		69	     114</p>
<p> Other operations		 -40	     -79	    -106</p>
<p> TOTAL				453	     423	     742</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
